WEBVTT

01:40.590 --> 01:44.270
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.030 --> 01:47.289
[Episode 11]

01:48.350 --> 01:50.310
We had Goddess Wushuang.

01:50.310 --> 01:51.590
We had craftsmanship!

01:51.630 --> 01:52.470
It was she who showed us

01:52.470 --> 01:53.789
a new way to survive,

01:54.310 --> 01:55.310
allowing us to protect ourselves,

01:55.310 --> 01:56.190
defend against enemies,

01:56.190 --> 01:57.590
and live with dignity!

01:57.590 --> 01:58.509
But you...

02:00.070 --> 02:02.150
you abandoned this path.

02:02.670 --> 02:04.430
You cut off your own lifeline,

02:04.670 --> 02:07.190
giving up the great legacy

02:07.190 --> 02:08.509
of our predecessors!

02:08.509 --> 02:09.860
This is betrayal!

02:17.990 --> 02:18.790
Today,

02:19.150 --> 02:21.590
if I can take the immortal from the Youhu Clan

02:21.940 --> 02:23.240
down with me,

02:23.240 --> 02:25.230
I'd call it a win!

02:25.590 --> 02:26.829
There are many others on the ship.

02:26.870 --> 02:28.190
They're all innocent!

02:28.190 --> 02:29.190
Guess they're unlucky.

02:29.190 --> 02:30.510
But killing them like this

02:31.270 --> 02:34.020
is better than letting them suffer

02:34.070 --> 02:36.190
under the oppression of the immortal race!

02:40.870 --> 02:43.230
Miss, I can see your craftsmanship is great.

02:43.390 --> 02:44.310
That mechanical bird of yours

02:44.310 --> 02:45.660
can save your life.

02:45.660 --> 02:46.910
After you escape,

02:47.710 --> 02:49.350
make sure to spread the word

02:49.350 --> 02:50.590
about what happened today.

02:50.590 --> 02:52.070
Let it serve as a warning to the world

02:52.840 --> 02:55.829
so our efforts won't be in vain.

02:56.030 --> 02:57.390
No, I'm just...

02:57.829 --> 02:59.230
You must not reveal

02:59.230 --> 03:00.670
your identity to anyone.

03:00.740 --> 03:03.550
If you do, your divine soul will be destroyed.

03:07.800 --> 03:08.590
Let's go!

03:41.900 --> 03:43.780
Yuanzhong, I'll go hold the ship.

03:43.829 --> 03:44.910
You use the power of the Divine Hand

03:44.910 --> 03:46.030
to provide power to the ship.

03:46.030 --> 03:47.710
Make sure it lands safely.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.590
Stop!

04:21.630 --> 04:22.420
It's alright now.

04:22.550 --> 04:23.740
We all survived.

04:24.070 --> 04:24.710
It's okay now.

04:24.710 --> 04:26.190
Slow down. Guys, slow down.

04:26.190 --> 04:27.670
We survived.

04:27.670 --> 04:28.790
We survived.

04:30.390 --> 04:31.230
Great!

04:31.430 --> 04:32.150
Great!

04:32.150 --> 04:33.430
We survived!

04:39.710 --> 04:40.630
It has stopped.

04:40.870 --> 04:42.150
The tower ship has stopped.

05:08.390 --> 05:10.360
Yuanzhong, do it now!

05:11.510 --> 05:12.590
Do it now!

05:13.630 --> 05:14.700
Do it!

05:15.990 --> 05:17.350
Do it!

05:22.860 --> 05:24.670
Do it!

05:56.630 --> 05:57.310
Are we safe now?

06:00.910 --> 06:02.430
We're saved, we're saved.

06:26.830 --> 06:28.030
We're really safe now.

06:28.820 --> 06:29.820
It's all over.

06:33.909 --> 06:34.870
The ship stopped falling.

06:52.350 --> 06:53.470
Have you two heard?

06:53.710 --> 06:54.670
A couple of days ago,

06:54.950 --> 06:57.390
a tower ship crashed at Bailiping.

06:57.390 --> 06:58.350
Really?

06:58.470 --> 07:01.310
I heard it belonged to the Shen family from Yandu.

07:01.430 --> 07:02.310
The Shen family?

07:02.470 --> 07:03.470
If the ship crashed,

07:03.470 --> 07:05.420
doesn't that mean everyone on board died?

07:05.510 --> 07:07.670
That's the strange part.

07:08.230 --> 07:09.310
I heard that

07:09.630 --> 07:11.470
there was an immortal

07:11.670 --> 07:14.350
from the Youhu Clan on board.

07:14.470 --> 07:15.590
That immortal,

07:15.590 --> 07:16.590
unable to bear the sight

07:16.590 --> 07:18.310
of so many innocent lives being lost,

07:18.510 --> 07:20.710
stepped in to help.

07:20.710 --> 07:22.670
With just a gentle lift of his hand,

07:23.270 --> 07:24.800
he raised the ship.

07:25.940 --> 07:27.990
It landed steadily on the ground.

07:28.140 --> 07:29.430
Not a single person died.

07:29.670 --> 07:30.790
He lifted that huge ship

07:30.830 --> 07:32.990
with just one hand?

07:33.070 --> 07:33.710
That's what makes him

07:33.710 --> 07:35.230
an immortal, doesn't it?

07:36.270 --> 07:37.909
Miss, your water.

07:40.430 --> 07:41.390
May I ask how to get to

07:41.390 --> 07:42.150
Bailiping?

07:42.230 --> 07:43.030
Follow this road

07:43.030 --> 07:44.230
straight ahead.

07:44.310 --> 07:45.790
You'll get there in two days.

07:46.190 --> 07:46.750
Thank you.

07:46.750 --> 07:47.710
If it weren't for that immortal,

07:47.790 --> 07:49.750
many families would've died.

07:50.590 --> 07:51.270
That's right.

07:51.270 --> 07:52.550
Immortals are certainly powerful,

07:52.909 --> 07:54.230
but the human craftsmanship

07:54.310 --> 07:55.430
isn't so bad either.

08:02.390 --> 08:04.240
[Destiny Tavern]

08:08.870 --> 08:10.590
Sir, we're out of wine.

08:10.590 --> 08:11.590
Two more jugs of wine, please.

08:12.180 --> 08:14.510
Got it. They'll be served soon.

08:15.990 --> 08:18.070
It's been raining for two days.

08:18.430 --> 08:19.750
When will it stop?

08:20.030 --> 08:21.790
I wish I knew.

08:21.990 --> 08:23.510
Of all places to get stuck,

08:23.510 --> 08:25.030
we're stuck in the middle of nowhere

08:25.030 --> 08:26.020
on a remote mountain.

08:26.590 --> 08:27.550
Just my luck.

08:28.230 --> 08:30.230
Miss, it's damp on rainy days.

08:30.230 --> 08:31.710
Have some hot soup to warm your stomach.

08:32.150 --> 08:32.950
Thank you.

08:49.740 --> 08:50.670
Soup's ready.

08:53.860 --> 08:54.860
Drink it while it's hot.

08:56.220 --> 08:57.030
Thank you.

08:59.960 --> 09:00.840
What is this?

09:01.630 --> 09:02.470
The Juque Sword.

09:08.950 --> 09:10.230
It's said to be the fifth sword

09:10.230 --> 09:11.630
forged by the Sword God, Ouye Zi.

09:11.870 --> 09:13.750
It can pierce copper and cut iron,

09:14.230 --> 09:15.270
unmatched in sharpness,

09:15.870 --> 09:17.830
able to slice through any divine weapon.

09:18.710 --> 09:19.750
I set out this time

09:20.070 --> 09:21.200
just to find it.

09:21.670 --> 09:22.910
Why do you want to find it?

09:27.180 --> 09:28.620
Regardless of the reason,

09:28.750 --> 09:29.870
since you want to find it,

09:30.150 --> 09:31.430
I'll definitely find it for you.

09:43.270 --> 09:45.510
Miss, traveling alone

09:45.510 --> 09:47.110
must be boring.

09:47.310 --> 09:49.590
Why don't you join us for a drink?

09:52.000 --> 09:54.200
Don't be so cold.

09:58.430 --> 09:59.230
Get lost.

10:01.460 --> 10:02.270
Go, go.

10:54.170 --> 10:56.120
Sir, I'd like a premium room.

10:56.360 --> 10:58.150
Sure. This way, please.

11:01.030 --> 11:01.830
Please, this way.

11:14.990 --> 11:16.790
The rain just stopped. I'll brew some tea.

11:16.790 --> 11:17.900
Have some before you leave

11:17.900 --> 11:18.750
to warm yourselves up.

11:19.390 --> 11:21.390
You sure packed well for this trip.

11:22.310 --> 11:23.470
Gotta be prepared when you're out traveling.

11:37.590 --> 11:38.550
Stop!

11:49.750 --> 11:50.630
Tea's ready.

11:50.740 --> 11:51.530
Thanks.

11:53.830 --> 11:55.150
It smells wonderful.

11:58.030 --> 11:59.710
Where are we headed now?

11:59.910 --> 12:00.720
We're going to find Kai Shan.

12:00.910 --> 12:02.110
Who's Kai Shan?

12:02.510 --> 12:03.270
My brother.

12:03.270 --> 12:04.630
We're all Yuanzhong's weapon spirits.

12:06.220 --> 12:08.390
The Divine Left Hand has two weapon spirits?

12:08.860 --> 12:10.270
Not just two. There are five in total.

12:10.510 --> 12:11.790
Impressive, isn't it?

12:14.830 --> 12:16.550
Yuanzhong, this tea is quite good.

12:16.550 --> 12:17.310
Try some.

12:32.030 --> 12:33.670
-Ji Tanyin…
-That day on the ship,

12:33.790 --> 12:35.630
you used the power of the Divine Hand to hold it up.

12:35.750 --> 12:36.710
It must have exhausted you.

12:37.470 --> 12:38.910
Are you feeling alright?

12:41.230 --> 12:42.030
I'm fine.

12:44.070 --> 12:44.910
That's good.

12:45.790 --> 12:48.150
But you've only just broken the seal.

12:48.360 --> 12:50.120
Your body hasn't fully recovered yet.

12:50.540 --> 12:51.830
You need to be careful.

12:58.390 --> 12:59.190
Oh, right.

12:59.750 --> 13:00.550
I saw

13:00.590 --> 13:02.150
Mr. Tanghua on the ship.

13:02.440 --> 13:03.910
We left that day

13:04.030 --> 13:05.550
without letting him know.

13:06.300 --> 13:07.350
Was that okay?

13:07.670 --> 13:08.870
I didn't let you know either,

13:09.230 --> 13:10.510
but you still followed me.

13:11.950 --> 13:14.390
Let's put the past behind us.

13:14.670 --> 13:16.110
I'm not upset anymore.

13:16.270 --> 13:18.030
So stop avoiding me, okay?

13:18.550 --> 13:20.710
If I say no, will you leave?

13:20.710 --> 13:21.430
No.

13:21.660 --> 13:23.030
Then why bother asking me?

13:28.310 --> 13:30.150
For a divine artifact to create a weapon spirit,

13:30.190 --> 13:31.550
it requires an incredible stroke of luck.

13:31.630 --> 13:33.230
I thought the Divine Left Hand

13:33.230 --> 13:34.830
only had one weapon spirit—Zi Fei.

13:34.830 --> 13:36.630
I never expected there to be five.

13:36.910 --> 13:38.260
It's truly astonishing.

13:39.990 --> 13:42.600
You seem to know a lot about this.

13:43.270 --> 13:44.070
Well,

13:44.870 --> 13:47.110
I just know a little about it.

13:55.310 --> 13:56.310
Back then, the Council of Elders

13:56.310 --> 13:57.310
bound me with the golden hoop,

13:57.830 --> 13:58.990
and my weapon spirits

13:58.990 --> 14:00.310
were imprisoned as well.

14:00.590 --> 14:02.420
Aside from Zi Fei, the other four

14:02.420 --> 14:03.590
were each sealed

14:03.590 --> 14:04.670
in different places.

14:05.630 --> 14:07.190
Now that I've escaped,

14:07.750 --> 14:09.270
I naturally want to set them free.

14:09.630 --> 14:10.870
Then I'll go with you.

14:15.110 --> 14:15.910
You've made up your mind

14:15.910 --> 14:16.950
to follow me?

14:18.240 --> 14:19.120
Don't worry.

14:19.240 --> 14:20.910
I'd never harm you.

14:21.110 --> 14:22.710
So stop avoiding me, okay?

14:22.710 --> 14:23.910
Don't push me away again.

14:27.600 --> 14:28.830
Then do something for me.

14:30.430 --> 14:31.230
100 miles east,

14:31.230 --> 14:32.270
there's a place called Shifang Town.

14:32.270 --> 14:33.590
In that town, there's an alley called Penglai Alley.

14:33.590 --> 14:34.070
Go there

14:34.070 --> 14:35.500
and find a family with the surname Bai.

14:35.630 --> 14:36.430
Give this letter

14:36.430 --> 14:37.510
to the head of that household.

14:37.510 --> 14:38.600
Tell him I'm here

14:38.600 --> 14:39.900
and bring him to see me.

14:45.230 --> 14:46.020
Well...

14:46.960 --> 14:48.390
Can't you send Zi Fei instead?

14:48.790 --> 14:50.630
You have the mechanical bird. You're faster.

14:50.870 --> 14:52.350
It won't take long for you to come back.

14:56.110 --> 14:58.230
What's wrong? You don't want to go?

14:58.350 --> 14:59.470
It's not that.

15:00.390 --> 15:01.670
Since you want to follow me,

15:01.710 --> 15:03.190
you have to do something for me.

15:03.630 --> 15:05.310
I don't keep idle people around.

15:09.350 --> 15:11.500
Fine. Forget it.

15:11.500 --> 15:12.430
Alright, alright.

15:12.550 --> 15:13.390
I'll go.

15:14.110 --> 15:15.270
But promise me

15:15.270 --> 15:16.440
that you won't wander around.

15:16.440 --> 15:17.470
You must wait for me here.

15:17.470 --> 15:18.750
Don't leave without me.

15:18.750 --> 15:19.470
I'll be back

15:19.470 --> 15:20.630
very soon.

15:21.550 --> 15:22.350
Off you go.

15:22.430 --> 15:23.230
Wait for me here.

15:28.510 --> 15:29.950
The mountains to the east stretch endlessly.

15:29.950 --> 15:30.590
There's no such place

15:30.590 --> 15:31.790
as Shifang Town or Penglai Alley.

15:31.790 --> 15:32.790
You lied to her again.

15:34.070 --> 15:35.270
It's useless, Yuanzhong.

15:35.270 --> 15:36.670
Her tracking skills are exceptional.

15:36.670 --> 15:37.550
If she finds out you tricked her,

15:37.550 --> 15:38.790
she'll catch up soon.

15:52.070 --> 15:53.230
He lied to me again.

15:58.620 --> 15:59.660
Come on, friends!

15:59.710 --> 16:00.630
Have you ever complained

16:00.630 --> 16:01.750
about the unfairness of this world?

16:01.750 --> 16:03.620
Have you ever felt your talents go unrecognized?

16:03.620 --> 16:04.910
No worries, look over here!

16:04.910 --> 16:05.950
Come to me!

16:05.950 --> 16:06.590
With one tael of silver,

16:06.590 --> 16:07.790
you can make your dream come true.

16:07.790 --> 16:08.430
With ten taels of silver,

16:08.430 --> 16:09.780
you can win a future for yourself.

16:09.780 --> 16:10.590
Remember,

16:10.590 --> 16:13.110
fortune never abandons the lucky ones.

16:13.350 --> 16:15.960
Come on, limited spots available! Place your bets now!

16:15.960 --> 16:17.150
Come on, place your bets!

16:17.390 --> 16:19.480
Place your bets. Life or death.

16:19.990 --> 16:20.780
Come on!

16:21.630 --> 16:23.270
Miss, what would you like to order?

16:23.270 --> 16:24.230
A helping of meat buns.

16:24.320 --> 16:25.750
Alright, please wait a moment.

16:27.590 --> 16:28.430
Excuse me.

16:28.990 --> 16:30.750
Is there anything else you need?

16:31.020 --> 16:31.830
I want to know...

16:31.950 --> 16:32.550
Is this mountain

16:32.550 --> 16:33.950
Yingong Mountain?

16:34.270 --> 16:35.230
Yingong Mountain?

16:35.630 --> 16:36.950
This is Baitou Mountain.

16:37.030 --> 16:38.080
Baitou Mountain?

16:38.080 --> 16:38.870
Yeah.

16:39.430 --> 16:40.830
Baitou Mountain

16:40.830 --> 16:42.110
is quite famous.

16:42.270 --> 16:43.950
There's a reclusive immortal living up there,

16:43.950 --> 16:45.750
known as Lord Mei Shan.

16:45.900 --> 16:47.460
People also call him Old Ghost Mei Shan.

16:47.680 --> 16:49.440
Immortals are hard to find elsewhere,

16:49.470 --> 16:50.990
but if you come to Baitou Mountain,

16:50.990 --> 16:51.910
seeing one is not

16:51.910 --> 16:52.710
difficult at all.

16:52.710 --> 16:53.630
Every now and then,

16:53.630 --> 16:54.150
you might even get to

16:54.150 --> 16:55.590
witness him facing his tribulations.

17:01.030 --> 17:01.840
Come on!

17:01.910 --> 17:03.390
A wild boar can't stomach fine bran.

17:03.390 --> 17:04.950
You can't make a silk purse out of a sow's ear.

17:04.990 --> 17:06.869
When it's time to be greedy, be greedy.

17:07.030 --> 17:08.880
Will he survive it or not? Place your bets!

17:09.030 --> 17:09.950
My dear friends,

17:09.950 --> 17:10.790
just go all in!

17:10.790 --> 17:12.069
What are they doing?

17:12.470 --> 17:13.190
Well,

17:13.190 --> 17:14.349
they're betting on whether Old Ghost Mei Shan

17:14.349 --> 17:16.109
will attain ascension this time

17:16.510 --> 17:17.550
or get struck dead

17:17.550 --> 17:18.750
by the heavenly lightning.

17:18.829 --> 17:19.630
Place your bets!

17:24.430 --> 17:25.910
Could you slow down a bit?

17:32.110 --> 17:33.430
No matter where we go,

17:33.430 --> 17:34.870
she always manages to catch up.

17:34.870 --> 17:36.110
She may show up soon.

17:36.110 --> 17:37.630
What should we do then?

17:37.790 --> 17:38.590
Stop her.

17:38.920 --> 17:39.830
Who's going to stop her?

17:39.830 --> 17:40.590
You, of course.

17:40.590 --> 17:41.270
Me?

17:41.950 --> 17:43.590
She's come back from death twice.

17:43.590 --> 17:44.310
Even death can't stop her.

17:44.310 --> 17:45.060
How can I?

17:45.060 --> 17:46.230
Figure it out yourself.

17:46.580 --> 17:48.950
Anyway, no matter what,

17:49.270 --> 17:50.630
don't let me see her again.

17:57.230 --> 17:58.310
Old Ghost Mei Shan

17:58.310 --> 17:59.430
is really something.

18:00.190 --> 18:01.670
Legend has it that years ago,

18:01.670 --> 18:02.940
he had already broken through his limits

18:03.310 --> 18:04.790
and should have ascended to godhood.

18:04.880 --> 18:06.390
But luck wasn't on his side.

18:06.470 --> 18:08.350
After the war between gods and demons, all gods vanished,

18:08.350 --> 18:10.190
the Gate of Heaven stayed closed, and the Divine Realm never appeared.

18:10.300 --> 18:11.670
So despite all his abilities,

18:11.670 --> 18:12.750
he couldn't ascend

18:12.750 --> 18:13.910
and had to stay in the mortal world.

18:14.470 --> 18:15.270
All these years,

18:15.270 --> 18:16.870
he's been undergoing tribulations again and again?

18:18.470 --> 18:20.110
That's why we call him unlucky.

18:20.510 --> 18:22.190
Every 49 days,

18:22.270 --> 18:23.310
Old Ghost Mei Shan

18:23.310 --> 18:24.990
has to face a tribulation—

18:25.230 --> 18:27.350
wind tribulation, fire tribulation, lightning tribulation…

18:27.350 --> 18:29.470
It's been quite a spectacle for us.

18:29.790 --> 18:32.030
He survives one tribulation only to face another,

18:32.110 --> 18:32.870
and each one

18:32.870 --> 18:34.630
is stronger than the last.

18:34.950 --> 18:36.150
Everyone's curious to see

18:36.190 --> 18:38.270
how long he can hold out.

18:38.630 --> 18:40.150
Isn't there also a love tribulation?

18:40.200 --> 18:42.400
Immortal Mei Shan's love for Xin Mei

18:42.670 --> 18:43.630
has brought him

18:43.630 --> 18:44.870
endless suffering.

18:47.630 --> 18:49.950
This Old Ghost Mei Shan you're talking about...

18:50.060 --> 18:50.990
Is he a friend

18:50.990 --> 18:52.500
of the Youhu Clan's High Priest?

18:52.630 --> 18:53.430
Friend?

18:55.350 --> 18:56.480
More like a sworn enemy.

18:56.980 --> 18:58.680
During the battle of Pinghu,

18:58.870 --> 19:01.070
the High Priest, while trying to kill the War Demons,

19:01.230 --> 19:03.230
accidentally sank Pinghu Xianzhou

19:03.230 --> 19:04.110
into the sea.

19:04.430 --> 19:05.630
And Pinghu Xianzhou

19:05.870 --> 19:07.270
happened to be

19:07.270 --> 19:08.470
Immortal Mei Shan's dwelling.

19:23.990 --> 19:24.870
And then?

19:25.350 --> 19:26.710
After that,

19:26.740 --> 19:27.790
Old Ghost Mei Shan

19:27.790 --> 19:29.510
moved to Baitou Mountain

19:29.790 --> 19:32.100
and never left it.

19:34.030 --> 19:35.550
60 years without leaving the mountain?

19:35.670 --> 19:36.590
Exactly.

19:36.910 --> 19:37.790
Who knows?

19:37.910 --> 19:39.190
Maybe the High Priest scared him

19:39.260 --> 19:40.230
out of his wits.

19:43.830 --> 19:46.030
Where is my head?

19:47.600 --> 19:50.280
Has anyone seen my head?

19:53.870 --> 19:56.110
There are so many heads here.

19:57.050 --> 19:59.930
Which one is mine?

20:03.750 --> 20:06.390
Lend me your head,

20:06.630 --> 20:08.270
will you?

20:11.590 --> 20:12.670
How dare you grab my neck!

20:12.670 --> 20:14.310
Bastard, do you have a death wish?

20:14.330 --> 20:15.720
I haven't seen you in 60 years.

20:15.950 --> 20:17.430
Your mouth is still as foul as ever.

20:18.140 --> 20:18.950
Yuanzhong?

20:20.430 --> 20:22.030
Perfect timing. Come up the mountain now.

20:54.070 --> 20:54.870
Mei Shan.

20:55.830 --> 20:56.710
Where the hell are you?

20:57.310 --> 20:58.110
Yuanzhong.

20:58.120 --> 20:59.130
I'm here.

21:01.790 --> 21:03.150
I'm not dead yet,

21:03.230 --> 21:05.150
but I'm getting close.

21:10.670 --> 21:12.190
It's over.

21:12.630 --> 21:13.790
It's all over.

21:13.790 --> 21:15.670
What am I supposed to do?

21:15.740 --> 21:17.830
Trouble always picks on the unlucky,

21:17.830 --> 21:18.990
and misfortune only befalls

21:18.990 --> 21:20.430
miserable guys like me.

21:23.260 --> 21:25.180
Yuanzhong, help me!

21:23.850 --> 21:25.360
[Mei Shan, sword cultivator, human race]

21:26.150 --> 21:27.550
So the rumors are true?

21:29.910 --> 21:30.590
What nonsense

21:30.590 --> 21:31.710
have they been spreading about me now?

21:31.790 --> 21:32.510
They say you made it through

21:32.510 --> 21:33.670
your tribulation years ago

21:33.670 --> 21:35.150
but failed to ascend to godhood,

21:35.150 --> 21:36.880
and you've been suffering from tribulations ever since.

21:40.270 --> 21:42.580
Well, they're not wrong.

21:42.750 --> 21:43.830
As you know,

21:43.870 --> 21:44.800
all gods vanished,

21:44.800 --> 21:45.680
the Gate of Heaven won't open,

21:45.680 --> 21:46.680
and there's no one to guide the way.

21:46.750 --> 21:48.110
How am I supposed to become a god?

21:48.150 --> 21:48.950
Yuanzhong,

21:49.230 --> 21:50.510
show me a way out

21:50.510 --> 21:51.910
and save this miserable soul.

21:51.910 --> 21:52.510
If you can't help me,

21:52.510 --> 21:53.550
just kill me and put me

21:53.550 --> 21:54.350
out of my misery

21:54.350 --> 21:56.030
so I won't have to live in constant fear.

21:58.350 --> 21:59.830
You've survived so many tribulations.

21:59.830 --> 22:01.350
So you should be experienced

22:01.350 --> 22:02.500
and well-prepared by now.

22:02.590 --> 22:03.630
What are you afraid of?

22:06.070 --> 22:06.950
This isn't

22:06.950 --> 22:08.510
about preparation.

22:08.830 --> 22:10.030
Those damn tribulations

22:10.030 --> 22:11.350
get stronger every time.

22:12.110 --> 22:13.550
One stab is bad enough.

22:13.670 --> 22:15.350
The second stab won't hurt any less.

22:15.430 --> 22:16.710
Get stabbed a few more times,

22:16.710 --> 22:17.920
and you're dead.

22:21.310 --> 22:22.880
If you keep talking like that,

22:23.910 --> 22:25.200
I might as well head back.

22:26.190 --> 22:27.670
Before coming down here, I checked the sky.

22:27.990 --> 22:29.550
A lot of thunderclouds had gathered.

22:29.750 --> 22:31.230
Given the amount of them, even I

22:31.230 --> 22:32.190
couldn't emerge unscathed.

22:32.790 --> 22:33.950
Aside from wishing you good luck,

22:34.200 --> 22:35.670
all I can offer is to clean up your remains afterward.

22:39.510 --> 22:40.510
Yuanzhong,

22:40.910 --> 22:42.590
this is a life-or-death situation.

22:42.750 --> 22:43.990
If you leave now,

22:43.990 --> 22:44.740
the next time you see me

22:44.740 --> 22:46.550
will be at my grave.

22:50.430 --> 22:51.350
Cut to the chase.

22:52.590 --> 22:53.750
It's all the fault

22:53.950 --> 22:55.670
of that drunkard Zhuo Fangsheng.

22:55.670 --> 22:57.110
He came by a while ago

22:57.110 --> 22:59.230
with two jars of Breath Suppressing Wine.

22:59.230 --> 23:00.150
He said drinking it

23:00.150 --> 23:01.350
could suppress my breath for a while

23:01.350 --> 23:02.350
so I could escape the tribulation.

23:03.670 --> 23:05.150
That drunkard's character is questionable,

23:05.150 --> 23:06.630
but his wine is good.

23:06.880 --> 23:07.790
Didn't it work?

23:08.750 --> 23:09.580
It worked.

23:09.630 --> 23:10.900
After I finished two jars of it,

23:10.900 --> 23:11.950
I passed out for half a year.

23:12.710 --> 23:14.710
But it only worked temporarily.

23:14.710 --> 23:15.470
I just sobered up,

23:15.470 --> 23:16.630
and the tribulation is coming again.

23:16.630 --> 23:17.270
Looks like

23:17.270 --> 23:18.230
all the tribulations

23:18.230 --> 23:19.200
I escaped during those six months

23:19.200 --> 23:20.870
are coming all at once this time.

23:26.790 --> 23:27.590
Yuanzhong,

23:28.250 --> 23:29.550
this frail body of mine

23:29.550 --> 23:30.990
can't take it.

23:34.510 --> 23:36.190
Wait a minute. How did you get out?

23:36.190 --> 23:37.590
Back then, you were sealed in Fangwai Mountain.

23:37.590 --> 23:38.310
I wanted to rescue you,

23:38.310 --> 23:39.510
but you flat-out refused.

23:40.060 --> 23:41.310
I came here to look for Kai Shan.

23:42.640 --> 23:45.080
You've broken free of the golden hoop?

23:49.270 --> 23:50.070
My savior,

23:50.910 --> 23:52.060
I'm counting on you

23:52.380 --> 23:53.870
to save my life.

23:54.750 --> 23:56.190
This lightning tribulation is not an ordinary one.

23:56.260 --> 23:57.160
Even I

23:57.270 --> 23:58.950
might not be able to take it all for you.

23:59.510 --> 24:00.390
That's good enough.

24:00.390 --> 24:01.390
Back then, when you fought me,

24:01.390 --> 24:03.190
you only used 20 percent of your power.

24:04.150 --> 24:05.670
That overwhelming power

24:05.750 --> 24:08.030
fully displayed your majestic demeanor.

24:08.470 --> 24:09.950
I've never forgotten it.

24:10.150 --> 24:10.780
Here's the plan:

24:10.780 --> 24:11.990
when I take the lightning later,

24:11.990 --> 24:13.310
you'll protect me.

24:13.310 --> 24:14.110
Before the lightning strikes,

24:14.110 --> 24:15.030
you must disperse

24:15.030 --> 24:16.030
the thunderclouds.

24:16.230 --> 24:17.470
Otherwise, lightning will keep coming,

24:17.510 --> 24:18.720
and it'll only get stronger.

24:32.910 --> 24:33.710
Stop right there!

24:35.590 --> 24:36.790
I knew you'd come.

24:36.830 --> 24:38.190
Yuanzhong doesn't allow you to go up the mountain.

24:38.270 --> 24:39.670
What is he doing here?

24:39.790 --> 24:41.580
Didn't he say he was going to find Kai Shan?

24:43.230 --> 24:44.240
I just don't understand.

24:44.240 --> 24:45.870
Why do you have to ditch me?

24:45.900 --> 24:46.630
Then why are you

24:46.630 --> 24:47.870
so determined to follow us?

24:48.390 --> 24:49.190
Ji Tanyin,

24:49.310 --> 24:50.470
it's not like you're an assassin

24:50.470 --> 24:51.310
sent by the human race

24:51.310 --> 24:52.470
or the War Demons.

24:52.470 --> 24:53.750
You don't want Yuanzhong's life.

24:53.750 --> 24:55.270
So why are you doing this?

24:56.150 --> 24:58.590
Could it be that you've fallen for him?

24:59.150 --> 24:59.870
Let me tell you,

24:59.870 --> 25:01.550
Yuanzhong is petty

25:01.550 --> 25:02.430
and selfish.

25:02.430 --> 25:03.910
He's not a good match for you.

25:03.990 --> 25:05.670
You're good-looking and skilled in craftsmanship.

25:05.670 --> 25:07.270
The world's full of better options,

25:07.510 --> 25:08.390
so stop wasting your time

25:08.390 --> 25:10.470
on a man like him.

25:15.790 --> 25:16.750
What are you looking for?

25:18.710 --> 25:20.230
Hey, listen to me.

25:20.840 --> 25:22.160
You'd better leave on your own.

25:22.270 --> 25:23.630
But if you refuse to go,

25:23.900 --> 25:24.670
I've come up with

25:24.670 --> 25:25.790
a compromise for you.

25:25.830 --> 25:26.990
Do you want to hear it?

25:27.270 --> 25:28.270
What compromise?

25:28.510 --> 25:29.830
Since you're so determined to follow us,

25:30.430 --> 25:31.670
why not stay three miles away

25:31.670 --> 25:32.670
and tail us from a distance?

25:32.830 --> 25:34.390
We won't meet or get in each other's way.

25:34.390 --> 25:35.980
Everyone's happy. How about that?

25:41.790 --> 25:42.670
What are you doing?

25:43.070 --> 25:43.830
Let's talk this out.

25:43.830 --> 25:44.550
I'm not gentle

25:44.550 --> 25:45.710
when I fight.

25:45.790 --> 25:46.990
I don't want to hurt you

25:46.990 --> 25:48.110
by accident.

25:52.190 --> 25:53.150
What is that?

25:53.910 --> 25:54.790
The Void Crossbow.

25:54.980 --> 25:55.730
Eyes can

25:55.750 --> 25:57.150
see things

25:57.150 --> 25:58.510
because of light.

25:58.510 --> 25:59.870
When light hits an object

25:59.870 --> 26:00.910
and reflects back into the eyes,

26:00.990 --> 26:01.870
the brain forms

26:01.870 --> 26:03.790
an image of that object.

26:04.390 --> 26:05.230
So,

26:05.270 --> 26:07.310
if all the light is absorbed,

26:07.310 --> 26:08.590
you won't be able to see me.

26:11.630 --> 26:13.540
Sounds impressive,

26:13.940 --> 26:15.460
though I didn't quite follow.

26:16.950 --> 26:18.710
So you're going to shoot me with that arrow

26:18.710 --> 26:20.230
to make me blind, right?

26:21.150 --> 26:23.020
I'm not going to use the Void Crossbow to shoot you.

26:24.310 --> 26:25.390
Don't give me that.

26:25.680 --> 26:27.000
I don't buy it.

26:33.230 --> 26:34.020
Where is she?

26:45.830 --> 26:47.870
Not letting me ascend is one thing,

26:47.870 --> 26:49.440
but trying to strike me dead?

26:49.550 --> 26:50.590
You think you can do that?

26:51.270 --> 26:52.990
I've given you so many chances all these years,

26:52.990 --> 26:54.500
but you never seized them.

26:54.870 --> 26:56.070
Now that my best buddy is here,

26:56.070 --> 26:57.430
you've got even less of a chance!

27:01.270 --> 27:02.070
I…

27:02.750 --> 27:03.640
I'm not backing down!

27:04.050 --> 27:05.050
Come on, hit me again!

27:05.080 --> 27:06.470
Don't chicken out like a coward!

27:06.750 --> 27:07.870
Stop provoking it, will you?

27:08.270 --> 27:10.110
Fate has backed me into a corner.

27:10.140 --> 27:11.170
If I still showed it respect after all this,

27:11.230 --> 27:12.300
wouldn't that make me an idiot?

27:18.310 --> 27:19.550
I'm coming!

27:25.640 --> 27:27.290
Yuanzhong, take it down.

27:42.670 --> 27:43.470
Run!

27:57.930 --> 28:00.300
♫Time never defeats the fleeting world♫

28:01.250 --> 28:04.030
♫Stars turn, shining upon the passing traveler♫

28:05.080 --> 28:08.050
♫The wind rises, flowers fall and bloom again♫

28:08.340 --> 28:11.080
♫Awaiting what's lost to be regained♫

28:12.490 --> 28:15.000
♫These countless sorrows and joys♫

28:15.780 --> 28:19.530
♫Dusk and dawn, only you make parting hard♫

28:19.640 --> 28:25.730
♫I'm willing to risk my life for this♫

28:26.890 --> 28:30.050
♫If our promise♫

28:30.060 --> 28:33.570
♫Is to share this land and rivers♫

28:34.230 --> 28:37.210
♫If fate leads us astray♫

28:37.280 --> 28:41.310
♫Life and death become our bond♫

28:41.560 --> 28:44.550
♫Storms heal with time♫

28:44.710 --> 28:48.670
♫Memories will shine in the end♫

28:49.670 --> 28:54.440
♫That very first heartbeat, I will remember until the last♫

28:57.470 --> 28:59.070
This girl was so good to you.

28:59.920 --> 29:00.700
Was she your friend?

29:04.470 --> 29:05.990
Yuanzhong said she was sent by War Demons

29:06.030 --> 29:07.350
to assassinate him.

29:09.350 --> 29:10.730
You call this an assassin?

29:10.830 --> 29:11.390
If you run into

29:11.390 --> 29:12.950
another "assassin" like her,

29:12.950 --> 29:14.630
could you introduce us?

29:14.630 --> 29:15.630
I'll take her home,

29:15.630 --> 29:16.590
treat her like a queen,

29:16.590 --> 29:17.580
and give her everything she wants.

29:18.590 --> 29:20.030
We don't understand her either.

29:20.140 --> 29:20.950
Come to think of it,

29:20.950 --> 29:21.790
this is the second time

29:21.790 --> 29:23.150
she's taken a hit for Yuanzhong.

29:28.590 --> 29:29.390
Alright.

29:29.980 --> 29:31.450
Whoever she was,

29:31.750 --> 29:34.270
she's gone now.

29:35.310 --> 29:36.630
Let's lay her to rest.

29:38.180 --> 29:39.180
She's dead.

29:39.550 --> 29:40.700
She's not an ordinary girl.

29:41.070 --> 29:42.350
She came back from death several times.

29:42.350 --> 29:43.630
Yuanzhong used the power of the Divine Hand

29:43.630 --> 29:45.390
to seal her in an icy lake,

29:45.710 --> 29:47.680
yet not long after, she revived.

29:49.510 --> 29:50.550
But this time is different.

29:50.860 --> 29:53.010
That lightning tribulation had been building up for half a year.

29:53.230 --> 29:55.310
Even Yuanzhong didn't dare take it head-on.

29:55.430 --> 29:56.190
No matter how strong she was,

29:56.190 --> 29:57.510
she was still just a human.

29:57.510 --> 29:58.750
How could she survive that?

30:01.450 --> 30:03.080
I don't know why she managed

30:03.270 --> 30:04.910
to come back from death again and again,

30:05.060 --> 30:06.750
but speaking from my own experience with tribulations,

30:06.870 --> 30:08.950
this time, she's done for.

30:09.710 --> 30:10.660
Even if

30:10.990 --> 30:12.110
it were an ancestor

30:12.110 --> 30:13.790
of the War Demons,

30:13.790 --> 30:15.310
they still couldn't survive that lightning strike.

30:35.310 --> 30:36.710
Why am I back again?

30:36.740 --> 30:37.810
How am I supposed to know?

30:37.870 --> 30:39.070
You tell me.

30:39.310 --> 30:40.870
You were summoned back by the Ascension Platform,

30:40.870 --> 30:42.150
and your primordial spirit was severely injured.

30:42.150 --> 30:44.310
If Hannv hadn't saved you,

30:44.310 --> 30:45.510
you might not have made it

30:45.510 --> 30:46.950
this time.

30:47.390 --> 30:49.030
Why was your primordial spirit

30:49.070 --> 30:50.220
so badly injured?

30:53.790 --> 30:54.700
It seems that

30:55.830 --> 30:56.870
I took a tribulation

30:57.110 --> 30:59.190
for Yuanzhong at Baitou Mountain.

30:59.270 --> 31:00.590
He's about to become a god?

31:01.950 --> 31:03.380
It was a friend of his.

31:03.870 --> 31:06.030
Yuanzhong tried to help him ascend

31:06.110 --> 31:07.390
using the Divine Hand, but it backfired,

31:07.710 --> 31:09.150
and the tribulation targeted him instead.

31:09.710 --> 31:11.070
I jumped in to save him,

31:11.390 --> 31:13.430
and the lightning struck me.

31:13.510 --> 31:15.190
You were so reckless.

31:15.240 --> 31:16.510
That was a tribulation—

31:16.560 --> 31:19.270
a test of the heavenly way to determine whether a soul

31:19.270 --> 31:20.670
is worthy of godhood.

31:20.840 --> 31:22.270
Interfering with that

31:22.310 --> 31:24.510
is going against the laws of heaven.

31:24.510 --> 31:26.630
No wonder your primordial spirit was injured.

31:29.730 --> 31:30.810
Hannv,

31:31.200 --> 31:33.080
why is it that someone

31:33.290 --> 31:35.440
can't ascend to godhood

31:35.680 --> 31:37.370
yet keep facing tribulations?

31:38.160 --> 31:39.280
During the war between gods and demons,

31:39.310 --> 31:40.470
the celestial ladder was destroyed.

31:40.470 --> 31:41.380
Since then, no one from the mortal realm

31:41.380 --> 31:42.830
has been able to ascend to godhood.

31:43.710 --> 31:44.670
But if

31:44.910 --> 31:46.160
someone's cultivation

31:46.160 --> 31:47.750
reaches the level required for ascension,

31:48.310 --> 31:50.390
the laws of heaven will sense it

31:50.430 --> 31:51.550
and give them a tribulation.

31:52.950 --> 31:56.030
Back when I faced my tribulation,

31:56.390 --> 31:59.940
I barely survived it.

32:00.910 --> 32:01.950
Even now,

32:01.950 --> 32:03.790
I still often dream about

32:03.790 --> 32:05.910
scenes from that tribulation.

32:08.270 --> 32:09.920
That guy's impressive.

32:09.990 --> 32:11.750
After enduring so many tribulations,

32:11.750 --> 32:13.440
he's actually still alive.

32:15.310 --> 32:16.990
Wasn't the Youhu Clan's High Priest

32:16.990 --> 32:18.590
sealed in Fangwai Mountain?

32:18.750 --> 32:20.480
How did he end up in Baitou Mountain?

32:21.810 --> 32:22.990
The Divine Left Hand

32:23.070 --> 32:24.910
created five weapon spirits in total.

32:25.270 --> 32:26.550
Aside from the one

32:26.550 --> 32:28.150
who's always by his side,

32:28.750 --> 32:29.870
the other four

32:29.950 --> 32:30.990
were sealed away back then

32:30.990 --> 32:32.390
just like he was.

32:33.150 --> 32:34.070
Now that

32:34.090 --> 32:36.050
he's broken free,

32:36.270 --> 32:38.110
he's naturally set out to rescue

32:38.110 --> 32:39.630
the other four weapon spirits.

32:40.030 --> 32:41.110
And Baitou Mountain

32:41.470 --> 32:42.870
is one of the stops.

32:43.020 --> 32:44.470
Five weapon spirits?

32:44.550 --> 32:46.150
That's incredible fortune.

32:49.910 --> 32:51.950
Your primordial spirit is severely damaged.

32:52.310 --> 32:53.270
It's not a minor injury.

32:53.470 --> 32:55.110
You won't be able to return for a while.

32:55.340 --> 32:57.470
Just stay in the Heavenly Realm and focus on your recovery.

34:20.469 --> 34:21.280
Tanyin.

34:22.870 --> 34:23.670
Tanyin.

34:32.310 --> 34:33.310
Deity Taihe?

34:38.230 --> 34:39.030
Tanyin.

34:41.670 --> 34:42.460
Come here.

34:57.350 --> 34:58.300
Yuanzhong…

35:00.390 --> 35:02.440
We need to meet soon.

35:35.910 --> 35:36.710
Tanyin.

35:39.430 --> 35:40.670
Why are you here?

35:41.350 --> 35:43.070
Didn't I tell you to get enough rest?

35:44.190 --> 35:45.540
Your injuries are serious.

35:45.670 --> 35:47.030
You have to take them seriously.

35:47.170 --> 35:48.910
I know. I just...

35:54.710 --> 35:55.550
Nothing.

35:56.830 --> 35:59.070
Luofu Sea is a place of extreme yin in the Heavenly Realm.

35:59.150 --> 36:00.110
Don't linger here for long.

36:00.550 --> 36:01.510
Go back

36:01.840 --> 36:03.270
before it harms your primordial spirit.

36:03.510 --> 36:04.870
You know it's a place of extreme yin,

36:04.870 --> 36:06.390
yet you still come here every day.

36:06.940 --> 36:08.230
I'm older

36:08.310 --> 36:09.470
and more powerful than you.

36:10.030 --> 36:11.550
Besides, your physical body is still in the mortal realm,

36:11.550 --> 36:12.910
and you've got responsibilities to carry.

36:13.230 --> 36:14.300
I'm not like you.

36:14.710 --> 36:16.110
I have nothing else to do

36:16.310 --> 36:17.830
but stay here.

36:20.390 --> 36:21.350
Do you remember

36:21.350 --> 36:22.430
what you promised me

36:22.590 --> 36:23.550
before you left last time?

36:25.190 --> 36:26.310
I promised that

36:26.550 --> 36:28.550
I wouldn't force you to kill him and take his hand for now.

36:28.750 --> 36:30.150
But you also promised me

36:30.300 --> 36:31.740
you wouldn't interfere with his fate

36:31.870 --> 36:33.430
or shield him from harm,

36:33.450 --> 36:34.250
didn't you?

36:36.310 --> 36:37.590
So what do you have to say this time?

36:38.480 --> 36:40.310
Everything happened too fast.

36:40.310 --> 36:41.150
At that time,

36:41.310 --> 36:43.070
I didn't even have time to think.

36:43.380 --> 36:45.190
Then I'll forgive you one more time.

36:46.030 --> 36:47.350
But if it happens again,

36:47.510 --> 36:48.910
I won't just let it slide.

36:49.630 --> 36:50.830
You may find it laughable,

36:51.270 --> 36:52.590
but I hold both respect and love

36:52.740 --> 36:54.590
for Deity Taihe.

36:55.070 --> 36:57.110
Even though he's the Primordial God

36:57.130 --> 36:58.610
who follows the path of detachment

36:58.830 --> 37:00.390
and is free from desire and attachments,

37:00.750 --> 37:02.030
my feelings for him

37:02.470 --> 37:03.640
have never changed.

37:05.630 --> 37:06.870
I can allow you

37:06.870 --> 37:08.710
to spare that guy's life for now.

37:09.190 --> 37:10.630
But if you keep protecting him

37:10.630 --> 37:11.670
from death,

37:12.530 --> 37:14.410
then you'll be my enemy.

37:21.790 --> 37:23.750
We've been friends for thousands of years.

37:24.070 --> 37:25.390
Don't let this matter

37:25.630 --> 37:26.710
drive us apart.

37:27.550 --> 37:28.230
Hannv…

37:28.230 --> 37:29.470
Alright. Enough.

37:29.750 --> 37:31.750
Go back to your palace.

37:39.390 --> 37:40.790
Has she always been like this?

37:41.030 --> 37:41.830
Yes.

37:42.190 --> 37:43.670
The witch doctor said that with her injuries,

37:43.750 --> 37:45.020
she should have died long ago.

37:45.590 --> 37:46.590
But there's some kind of power

37:46.590 --> 37:47.550
keeping her alive.

37:48.700 --> 37:51.220
I guess it's the power of a god.

37:52.870 --> 37:53.910
A god?

37:54.460 --> 37:55.270
Chief,

37:55.340 --> 37:56.830
Ming Zhang sent word

37:57.310 --> 37:58.310
that Qian Lin

37:58.430 --> 37:59.910
once boarded a human tower ship

37:59.910 --> 38:00.590
and ran into

38:00.590 --> 38:01.870
the Youhu Clan's High Priest.

38:01.990 --> 38:03.310
That kid attacked him recklessly,

38:03.550 --> 38:05.280
got seriously injured, and escaped.

38:05.630 --> 38:07.480
It's unknown whether he's still alive.

38:07.920 --> 38:10.590
The God-Slaying Dagger has also gone missing.

38:10.710 --> 38:11.710
Send people out.

38:12.190 --> 38:13.620
No matter the cost,

38:13.710 --> 38:14.780
find him.

38:14.960 --> 38:15.750
Yes.

38:16.550 --> 38:17.510
Ming Zhang has gone to Yandu

38:17.510 --> 38:18.430
to track down those people.

38:18.430 --> 38:19.150
I believe

38:19.150 --> 38:20.470
he'll send word back soon.

38:29.630 --> 38:31.390
How's he doing? Still in there?

38:32.070 --> 38:33.150
He never left.

38:34.510 --> 38:36.190
He just lost a handmaiden,

38:36.190 --> 38:36.870
yet he's acting like

38:36.870 --> 38:38.030
his wife died.

38:38.830 --> 38:39.750
Don't say that.

38:40.020 --> 38:41.580
Ji Tanyin was really nice.

38:41.580 --> 38:43.510
Maybe she's not really gone.

38:43.710 --> 38:45.070
She might come back to life again.

38:46.550 --> 38:47.950
"Come back to life again."

38:47.980 --> 38:48.780
Are you dreaming?

38:48.830 --> 38:49.590
She's gone for good.

38:49.590 --> 38:50.150
If she woke up,

38:50.150 --> 38:50.700
I'd let you

38:50.700 --> 38:51.790
sit on my head.

39:20.990 --> 39:22.440
What a heartbreaking sight.

39:22.460 --> 39:23.900
I feel like crying.

39:24.990 --> 39:25.790
Yuanzhong.

39:26.630 --> 39:29.590
You like her, don't you?

39:30.340 --> 39:31.390
Don't be shy.

39:31.910 --> 39:33.110
Feelings

39:33.270 --> 39:34.790
are just tricky like this.

39:35.190 --> 39:37.590
You don't realize what they mean

39:38.110 --> 39:41.070
until the person's gone and leaves you full of regrets.

39:42.350 --> 39:43.630
I've been there.

39:43.630 --> 39:44.400
Back when I…

39:46.390 --> 39:47.190
Yuanzhong!

39:48.030 --> 39:48.870
Listen,

39:48.950 --> 39:50.470
she's been lying dead for so many days.

39:50.470 --> 39:52.230
Before she wakes up, she'll rot first!

40:25.310 --> 40:26.110
What are you doing?

40:27.750 --> 40:29.870
Are you… trying to take advantage of me?

40:29.890 --> 40:30.690
I...

40:31.330 --> 40:32.730
I... I'll go get someone.

40:36.590 --> 40:37.390
Mei Shan.

40:37.660 --> 40:38.860
She's awake, she's awake!

40:39.340 --> 40:41.020
Who's awake? Ji Tanyin is awake?

40:42.270 --> 40:43.870
Unbelievable.

40:51.840 --> 40:52.630
Do I need to...

40:53.510 --> 40:54.750
Well, um...

40:55.830 --> 40:57.910
Didn't you say she woke up?

41:01.110 --> 41:02.390
She really did just now.

41:05.010 --> 41:05.990
Are you sure?

41:19.070 --> 41:19.870
How is she?

41:23.180 --> 41:24.270
Tell me, how is she?

41:28.430 --> 41:29.230
Give me your hand.

41:29.940 --> 41:30.680
What for?

41:30.710 --> 41:31.500
Give me your hand.

41:36.870 --> 41:37.590
I'm not asking about myself.

41:37.590 --> 41:38.910
I'm asking how she is.

41:38.910 --> 41:39.750
Her?

41:39.750 --> 41:40.870
She's been dead for several days.

41:40.870 --> 41:42.150
What do you expect?

41:42.680 --> 41:44.030
But she just talked to me.

41:44.110 --> 41:45.540
She talked to you just now?

41:49.310 --> 41:50.110
Yuanzhong.

41:51.080 --> 41:53.200
Maybe you're overwhelmed with grief

41:53.350 --> 41:54.630
and had hallucinations.

41:54.830 --> 41:55.910
It's understandable.

41:57.550 --> 41:58.960
This is too much for you.

42:04.350 --> 42:05.150
Hallucinations?

42:22.180 --> 42:24.350
Are you about to leave,

42:24.350 --> 42:26.190
or did you just come back?

42:28.670 --> 42:30.020
I was about to leave,

42:30.270 --> 42:31.350
but there's something

42:31.350 --> 42:31.990
I think I should

42:31.990 --> 42:33.350
let you know first.

42:33.470 --> 42:34.390
What is it?

42:35.150 --> 42:36.550
Earlier, I had a dream

42:36.580 --> 42:38.210
about Deity Taihe

42:39.000 --> 42:39.990
and Yuanzhong.

42:41.470 --> 42:42.470
A dream?

42:43.640 --> 42:45.030
Something felt off about both of them.

42:45.350 --> 42:46.150
In that dream,

42:46.150 --> 42:47.800
I seemed to be very afraid of them,

42:48.030 --> 42:49.590
like I didn't know them at all.

42:49.630 --> 42:50.790
Tell me

42:50.810 --> 42:52.150
what you saw in that dream.
